  "description": "Pneumatic and solid tire manufacturing: rubber compounding, calendered cord fabric, green-tire building on a drum, and press curing (vulcanization). Produces the only practical interface between a wheeled vehicle and the road — transmitting acceleration, braking, and lateral loads through a compliant air cushion (pneumatic) or a solid elastomeric mass (solid).",
